  "turn": 1,
  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "Transaction **TX-0401** (240.00 EUR, TechMart Online, 20 July 2026, settled) is on account ACC-1005. For a purchase where the goods never arrived, the applicable reason code is **`goods_not_received`**. Its dispute window is 90 days from the transaction date, so it closes on 18 October 2026.\n\nI also see a second 240.00 EUR charge to TechMart Online, TX-0402, dated 14 July 2026. If that was a separate charge for the same order, `duplicate_charge` would be the code for it (60-day window, from 14 July). I can check that transaction too.\n\nI haven't opened a dispute. Would you like me to run the eligibility check on TX-0401 with `goods_not_received` and then open the dispute if it passes?",
